on":"exasol/administration/","title":"Administra\u00e7\u00e3o","text":"<p>Comandos frequentes de administra\u00e7\u00e3o.</p>"},{"location":"exasol/backup/","title":"Backup &amp; Restore","text":"<p>Procedimentos de backup.</p>"},{"location":"exasol/bucketfs/","title":"BucketFS","text":"<p>Gest\u00e3o de ficheiros no BucketFS.</p>"},{"location":"exasol/dbeaver/","title":"DBeaver","text":"<p>Liga\u00e7\u00e3o e administra\u00e7\u00e3o atrav\u00e9s do DBeaver.</p>"},{"location":"github/","title":"GitHub","text":"<p>Documenta\u00e7\u00e3o GitHub, GitHub Pages e MkDocs.</p>"},{"location":"github/git-basics/","title":"Git B\u00e1sico","text":""},{"location":"github/git-basics/#clone","title":"Clone","text":"<p>```bash git clone URL</p>"},{"location":"github/github-pages/","title":"GitHub Pages","text":"<p># GitHub Pages</p> <p>O GitHub Pages permite publicar sites est\u00e1ticos diretamente a partir de um reposit\u00f3rio GitHub.</p>"},{"location":"github/github/","title":"GitHub","text":"<p>Documenta\u00e7\u00e3o Git e GitHub.</p>"},{"location":"github/mkdocs/","title":"MkDocs","text":"<p>Gerador de documenta\u00e7\u00e3o baseado em Markdown.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/","title":"Kubernetes","text":"<p>Plataforma de orquestra\u00e7\u00e3o de containers.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/#objetivos","title":"Objetivos","text":"<ul> <li>Implementar aplica\u00e7\u00f5es</li> <li>Escalar servi\u00e7os</li> <li>Gerir disponibilidade</li> <li>Automatizar opera\u00e7\u00f5es</li> </ul>"},{"location":"kubernetes/#areas","title":"\u00c1reas","text":"<ul> <li>Arquitetura</li> <li>Pods</li> <li>Namespaces</li> <li>Deployments</li> <li>ReplicaSets</li> <li>StatefulSets</li> <li>Services</li> <li>Ingress</li> <li>Volumes</li> <li>Persistent Volumes</li> <li>ConfigMaps</li> <li>Secrets</li> <li>Helm</li> <li>Troubleshooting</li> <li>Labs</li> </ul>"},{"location":"kubernetes/architecture/","title":"Arquitetura Kubernetes","text":""},{"location":"kubernetes/architecture/#visao-geral","title":"Vis\u00e3o Geral","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nCP[Control Plane]\n\nCP --&gt; API[API Server]\n\nCP --&gt; SCH[Scheduler]\n\nCP --&gt; CM[Controller Manager]\n\nCP --&gt; ETCD[etcd]\n\nW1[Worker Node 1]\n\nW1 --&gt; K1[kubelet]\n\nW1 --&gt; P1[Pods]\n\nW2[Worker Node 2]\n\nW2 --&gt; K2[kubelet]\n\nW2 --&gt; P2[Pods]\n\nAPI --&gt; W1\n\nAPI --&gt; W2</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/configmaps/","title":"ConfigMaps Configura\u00e7\u00e3o desacoplada da aplica\u00e7\u00e3o.","text":""},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/","title":"Deployments","text":"<p>Deployments gerem Pods de forma declarativa.</p> <p>Permitem:</p> <ul> <li>Escalar aplica\u00e7\u00f5es</li> <li>Atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es controladas</li> <li>Rollback</li> <li>Auto-recupera\u00e7\u00e3o</li> </ul>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#arquitetura","title":"Arquitetura","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nA[Deployment]\n--&gt; B[ReplicaSet]\n\nB --&gt; C[Pod 1]\nB --&gt; D[Pod 2]\nB --&gt; E[Pod 3]</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#listar-deployments","title":"Listar Deployments","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get deployments\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#criar-deployment","title":"Criar Deployment","text":"<pre><code>kubectl create deployment nginx \\\n--image=nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#escalar","title":"Escalar","text":"<pre><code>kubectl scale deployment nginx \\\n--replicas=3\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#atualizar-imagem","title":"Atualizar imagem","text":"<pre><code>kubectl set image deployment/nginx \\\nnginx=nginx:latest\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#historico","title":"Hist\u00f3rico","text":"<pre><code>kubectl rollout history deployment nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#rollback","title":"Rollback","text":"<pre><code>kubectl rollout undo deployment nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#ver-estado","title":"Ver estado","text":"<pre><code>kubectl rollout status deployment nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#troubleshooting","title":"Troubleshooting","text":"<p>Ver deployment:</p> <pre><code>kubectl describe deployment nginx\n</code></pre> <p>Ver pods relacionados:</p> <pre><code>kubectl get pods\n</code></pre> <p>Ver eventos:</p> <pre><code>kubectl get events\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/helm/","title":"Helm","text":"<p>Helm \u00e9 o gestor de pacotes do Kubernetes.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/helm/#fluxo","title":"Fluxo","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nChart\n\n--&gt; Helm\n\nHelm\n\n--&gt; Deployment\n\nDeployment\n\n--&gt; Pods</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/helm/#ver-repositorios","title":"Ver reposit\u00f3rios","text":"<pre><code>helm repo list\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/helm/#adicionar-repositorio","title":"Adicionar reposit\u00f3rio","text":"<pre><code>helm repo add bitnami https://charts.bitnami.com/bitnami\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/helm/#instalar-nginx","title":"Instalar NGINX","text":"<pre><code>helm install nginx bitnami/nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/ingress/","title":"Ingress","text":"<p>Ingress permite publicar aplica\u00e7\u00f5es HTTP e HTTPS.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/ingress/#arquitetura","title":"Arquitetura","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nInternet\n\n--&gt; Ingress\n\nIngress --&gt; App1\n\nIngress --&gt; App2\n\nIngress --&gt; App3</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/ingress/#ver-ingress","title":"Ver Ingress","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get ingress\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/ingress/#exemplo","title":"Exemplo","text":"<pre><code>apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\n\nkind: Ingress\n\nmetadata:\n  name: web-ingress\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/mermaid-test/","title":"Teste Mermaid","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nA[Docker]\n--&gt; B[Kubernetes]\n\nB --&gt; C[Pods]\nB --&gt; D[Services]</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/","title":"Namespaces","text":"<p>Namespaces permitem separar recursos dentro de um cluster.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#estrutura","title":"Estrutura","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nC[Cluster Kubernetes]\n\nC --&gt; D[Development]\n\nC --&gt; T[Test]\n\nC --&gt; P[Production]</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#listar","title":"Listar","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get ns\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#criar","title":"Criar","text":"<pre><code>kubectl create namespace dev\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#apagar","title":"Apagar","text":"<pre><code>kubectl delete namespace dev\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#ver-recursos-de-um-namespace","title":"Ver recursos de um namespace","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get all -n dev\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#exemplo","title":"Exemplo","text":"<pre><code>apiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\n\nmetadata:\n  name: dev\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/persistent-volumes/","title":"Persistent Volumes","text":"<p>Permitem armazenamento persistente.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/persistent-volumes/#arquitetura","title":"Arquitetura","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nPod\n\n--&gt; PVC\n\nPVC\n\n--&gt; PV\n\nPV\n\n--&gt; Storage</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/persistent-volumes/#ver-pv","title":"Ver PV","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get pv\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/persistent-volumes/#ver-pvc","title":"Ver PVC","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get pvc\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/","title":"Pods","text":"<p>Os Pods s\u00e3o a unidade mais pequena execut\u00e1vel no Kubernetes.</p> <p>Um Pod pode conter um ou mais containers.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#arquitetura","title":"Arquitetura","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nN[Worker Node]\n\nN --&gt; P[Pod]\n\nP --&gt; C1[Container App]\n\nP --&gt; C2[Container Sidecar]</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#criar-um-pod","title":"Criar um Pod","text":"<pre><code>kubectl run nginx --image=nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#listar-pods","title":"Listar Pods","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get pods\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#ver-detalhes","title":"Ver detalhes","text":"<pre><code>kubectl describe pod nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#ver-logs","title":"Ver logs","text":"<pre><code>kubectl logs nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#entrar-no-pod","title":"Entrar no Pod","text":"<pre><code>kubectl exec -it nginx -- bash\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#ciclo-de-vida","title":"Ciclo de Vida","text":"<pre><code>stateDiagram-v2\n\nPending --&gt; Running\nRunning --&gt; Succeeded\nRunning --&gt; Failed\nRunning --&gt; Unknown</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/secrets/","title":"Secrets","text":"<p>Armazenamento seguro de credenciais.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/services/","title":"Services","text":"<p>Os Services permitem expor Pods.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/services/#fluxo","title":"Fluxo","text":"<pre><code>graph LR\n\nU[Utilizador]\n\nU --&gt; S[Service]\n\nS --&gt; P1[Pod 1]\n\nS --&gt; P2[Pod 2]\n\nS --&gt; P3[Pod 3]</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/services/#listar","title":"Listar","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get svc\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/services/#exemplo-service","title":"Exemplo Service","text":"<pre><code>apiVersion: v1\n\nkind: Service\n\nmetadata:\n  name: nginx-service\n\nspec:\n  selector:\n    app: nginx\n\n  ports:\n    - port: 80\n      targetPort: 80\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"linux/","title":"Linux","text":"<p>Documenta\u00e7\u00e3o Linux.</p>"},{"location":"linux/commands/","title":"Comandos \u00dateis","text":""},{"location":"linux/commands/#ver-espaco-em-disco","title":"Ver espa\u00e7o em disco","text":"<p>```bash df -h</p>"},{"location":"linux/scripts/","title":"Shell Scripts","text":"<p># Shell Scripts</p> <p>Exemplos de automa\u00e7\u00e3o Linux.</p>"}]}